{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The fused attention backend was slower at this unusually wide 512-element head, so I retained explicit QK/softmax/AV. Combining QKV and the two time projections into larger GEMMs is locally faster and still above the required match ratio. I’m also removing redundant allocations with numerically identical in-place pointwise operations; strict-shape computation order and kernels remain otherwise unchanged."}}
